</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/399bba0c-a792-11f1-8217-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/Reporters-26082026.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/399bba0c-a792-11f1-8217-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/Reporters-26082026.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">c0da0eee-a78b-11f1-9f18-132471c30123</guid><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 12:03:26 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>Fanny ALLARD</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>Argentina's Milei escalates Falklands dispute in sovereignty push against Britain</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260904-argentina-s-milei-escalates-falklands-dispute-in-sovereignty-push-against-britain</link><description>
Argentine President Javier Milei said he would sanction oil companies drilling in the Falkland Islands, the British overseas territory claimed by Argentina, in a move which could escalate tensions with London. Milei's comments in a televised national ​address on Thursday came ‌days after US President Donald Trump said he was reviewing the United States' neutral position on the ⁠remote archipelago in the South Atlantic.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/8c52abc8-9aa6-11f1-a07f-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26061025634978.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/8c52abc8-9aa6-11f1-a07f-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26061025634978.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">6c4f4ebe-a841-11f1-bd59-e71901705b94</guid><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 10:07:32 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>Deadlocked jury in Lindsay Clancy's children murder trial deliberates for sixth day</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/deadlocked-jury-in-lindsay-clancy-s-children-murder-trial-deliberates-for-sixth-day</link><description>
